<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Making Christ experiential,</l><l>God at His pure Word I take;</l><l>As the Spirit joined unto me,</l><l>He cannot His promise break.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Based upon the blood that cleanses</l><l>So that nothing stands between,</l><l>Christ, the ointment, moves within me!</l><l>For His move I’m made so clean.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God in Christ as life in Spirit</l><l>Into my own spirit came!</l><l>He the Holy One anoints me</l><l>Till in spirit we’re the same.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>God in Spirit; I can touch Him;</l><l>In my spirit He’s the flow.</l><l>Deeper, wider, richer, fuller—</l><l>Oh, the very God I know!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>As I heed “that same anointing”</l><l>Ever to “abide in Him,”</l><l>He is teaching, He is reaching,</l><l>Even all my heart to win.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
